      "content": "SP 80 NW           ELLESBOROUGH            DROPSHORT                                            (MISSENDEN ROAD) 2/18                                       Jasmine Cottage - -                                         II House.  Late C18-early C19, altered and extended C20.  Flint and clunch rubble with brick dressings and ornamental glass bottle ends. Hipped thatch roof, brick chimney to left of centre.  2 storeys, 2 bays. C20 paired leaded casements, smaller to first floor.  Central board door.  Ground floor openings have segmental heads.  C20 matching extensions to rear. Listing NGR: SP8435806664"
    }
